A map of the Thebes example applications, shared modules and CLI for AI
agents. The files under interfaces/ are generated by the Motoko compiler from
the example repositories listed in sources.json, each under its own license.

The contracts are written in Motoko and speak Candid, both developed by the
DFINITY Foundation (https://dfinity.org). With thanks to the DFINITY team for
their excellent work.
